The mobile client performs speech recognition with pre-trained models from the
k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx project. Those models are NOT redistributed in this repository;
`mobile/tool/fetch-models.sh` downloads them from their upstream model repositories
and verifies them by checksum:

  - csukuangfj/sherpa-onnx-streaming-zipformer-small-ctc-zh-int8-2025-04-01
  - csukuangfj/sherpa-onnx-paraformer-zh-small-2024-03-09

Their terms are those of the upstream repositories. This project grants no license
to them.

Speech recognition itself runs through the `sherpa_onnx` Dart package
(k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx, Apache-2.0), declared in `mobile/pubspec.yaml` and resolved by
the Dart package manager. Other third-party dependencies are declared in
`package-lock.json`, `mobile/pubspec.lock` and `go/go.sum`, and remain under their
own licenses.
